  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1312.10 Seat Belt Cutter. Each multipurpose passenger vehicle shall have a seat belt cutter which shall be securely mounted in an easily accessible location in the driver's compartment.\n\nSource. #4873, eff 07-24-90; ss by #6297, eff 7-23-96; ss by #8248, eff 1-4-05; ss by #10439, eff 10-11-13 (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1300); ss by #14005, eff 6-22-24, EXPIRES: 6-22-34 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1300)",
